msgid "SLE 节点实体 -- 统一收发接口。"
msgstr "SLE node entity — unified TX/RX interface."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/node.py:9
msgid "将 MAC/PHY 各模块整合为单一 SLE 节点, 提供完整的链路生命周期管理 和数据收发能力。支持仿真模式和 USRP 硬件模式。"
msgstr ""
"Integrates all MAC/PHY modules into a single SLE node, providing complete"
" link lifecycle management and data TX/RX capability. Supports simulation"
" mode and USRP hardware mode."

